WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
In Markup, choose Highlight and drag across text.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Select a highlight to change its colour.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Choose Underline and drag across the next text.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Choose Strikeout to mark wording for review.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.530
Select the markup to adjust its appearance.
